1
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:20,850
[Sung Inho]

2
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,480
[Kim Domin]

3
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:49,990
[Summertime]

4
00:00:58,200 --> 00:00:59,390
I like you.

5
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:02,220
Will it make you feel better
to pretend everything I do

6
00:01:02,220 --> 00:01:03,420
is just a joke?

7
00:01:03,490 --> 00:01:05,319
You know my feelings for you.

8
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:06,470
Don't you?

9
00:01:06,550 --> 00:01:09,210
You weren't sleeping
in the classroom that day.

10
00:01:16,210 --> 00:01:17,590
You jerk.

11
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:29,450
Are you okay?

12
00:01:34,550 --> 00:01:36,479
Hey. I heard Eunho got into an accident.

13
00:01:36,479 --> 00:01:37,820
What? You saw it?

14
00:01:38,590 --> 00:01:40,170
I saw him in the nurse's office.

15
00:01:40,170 --> 00:01:41,509
He was covered in blood.

16
00:01:43,270 --> 00:01:46,130
Why are you running in the hallway
in the morning...

17
00:01:56,150 --> 00:01:57,340
Dohyun...

18
00:01:58,630 --> 00:02:00,180
Mom and Dad...

19
00:02:00,630 --> 00:02:02,660
What are we going to do now?

20
00:02:36,780 --> 00:02:38,500
Whether it's taekwondo or studying—

21
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:40,560
nothing's easy.

22
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,290
But Yeo Eunho...

23
00:02:46,460 --> 00:02:48,390
you're really hard to understand.

24
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:50,450
So...

25
00:02:51,750 --> 00:02:54,510
there must be another way, you jerk.

26
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:57,160
If I don't do this,

27
00:02:57,840 --> 00:03:00,330
can you see my feelings for you?

28
00:03:02,270 --> 00:03:06,160
Yeo Eunho. Just give it to me straight.

29
00:03:08,470 --> 00:03:09,560
What?

30
00:03:09,970 --> 00:03:12,280
If you don't like me, just say so.

31
00:03:15,460 --> 00:03:17,570
If you say you don't like me,

32
00:03:20,270 --> 00:03:23,130
I'll never do anything
that crosses the line again.

33
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:15,230
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

34
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,380
Drink up.

35
00:05:17,780 --> 00:05:18,840
It's so darn good.

36
00:05:19,050 --> 00:05:20,950
Hey, do you have water?

37
00:05:21,130 --> 00:05:22,260
It was so hard for me to bring this.

38
00:05:22,260 --> 00:05:23,090
You have to drink it.

39
00:05:23,090 --> 00:05:24,270
You should've bought water.

40
00:05:24,270 --> 00:05:25,520
Drink the alcohol.

41
00:05:25,940 --> 00:05:27,840
I said to drink this instead of soju.

42
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:29,280
Go get some water!

43
00:05:30,850 --> 00:05:32,720
You scared me!

44
00:05:34,550 --> 00:05:35,440
Eunho!

45
00:05:36,230 --> 00:05:37,440
Do you see this?

46
00:05:39,590 --> 00:05:41,409
21 years—it's a 21-year alcohol.

47
00:05:41,409 --> 00:05:42,830
It's super expensive!

48
00:05:43,830 --> 00:05:45,490
Eunho, just go.

49
00:05:45,780 --> 00:05:46,840
Why?

50
00:05:47,159 --> 00:05:48,620
If that darn Cha Dohyun finds out,
we'll be—

51
00:05:48,620 --> 00:05:52,200
Hey. All you have to do is say nothing.

52
00:05:52,940 --> 00:05:55,280
You were the tattletale.

53
00:05:55,430 --> 00:05:57,430
I'm not—

54
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:59,550
why are you so rude today?

55
00:05:59,690 --> 00:06:00,790
Yeah, Eunho.

56
00:06:00,950 --> 00:06:02,860
You don't drink anyway.

57
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:04,960
-I drink.
-What?

58
00:06:06,050 --> 00:06:08,410
You drink? Since when?

59
00:06:08,960 --> 00:06:10,340
Since now.

60
00:06:11,060 --> 00:06:12,970
Since we have a new guest,

61
00:06:13,190 --> 00:06:14,540
he should have a drink.

62
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,190
Give it to him.

63
00:06:19,290 --> 00:06:20,830
Are you sure?

64
00:06:21,300 --> 00:06:23,390
Are you that scared of him?

65
00:06:23,980 --> 00:06:26,660
I'm just worried about you.

66
00:06:27,900 --> 00:06:29,330
You coward.

67
00:06:29,580 --> 00:06:30,460
Cheers.

68
00:06:30,590 --> 00:06:32,890
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

69
00:06:44,130 --> 00:06:46,170
-Eunho, pass me the glass.
-You're quite good at drinking.

70
00:06:46,170 --> 00:06:47,210
It's empty.

71
00:06:47,580 --> 00:06:49,300
You walk in,

72
00:06:49,420 --> 00:06:51,280
but you have to crawl out.

73
00:06:51,300 --> 00:06:52,580
You and Gunwoo need to get drunk
to get out.

74
00:06:52,580 --> 00:06:53,310
Got it?

75
00:06:53,570 --> 00:06:54,880
Let's get drunk.

76
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:10,530
[Cha Dohyun]

77
00:07:11,820 --> 00:07:12,740
Hey.

78
00:07:13,750 --> 00:07:16,010
Who was the person
holding your hand last night?

79
00:07:16,010 --> 00:07:17,270
Gosh! Who was it?

80
00:07:18,540 --> 00:07:20,330
-Me?
-Yeah.

81
00:07:21,330 --> 00:07:23,670
Someone saw you coming out of the karaoke.

82
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:25,070
At 1:05 a.m.

83
00:07:25,170 --> 00:07:26,750
Hey, I heard about it too.

84
00:07:27,700 --> 00:07:29,230
What are you talking about?

85
00:07:30,070 --> 00:07:33,120
Look at him being all shy.

86
00:07:33,290 --> 00:07:35,450
Hey! Did you kiss?

87
00:07:35,580 --> 00:07:38,330
Crazy bastard.
Not yet!

88
00:07:39,220 --> 00:07:40,420
Not yet?

89
00:07:41,070 --> 00:07:43,540
Tell me an alphabet and number you like.

90
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:46,770
H, 2.

91
00:07:47,340 --> 00:07:48,810
That's...

92
00:07:49,740 --> 00:07:50,830
Crazy bastard.

93
00:07:51,150 --> 00:07:51,909
That's enough.

94
00:07:51,909 --> 00:07:53,640
You've never kissed, have you?

95
00:07:57,350 --> 00:07:59,240
-What are you doing?
-Get lost!

96
00:07:59,890 --> 00:08:02,000
Get lost!

97
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:06,220
Why are you just sitting here?

98
00:08:06,270 --> 00:08:07,160
[Cha Dohyon]

99
00:08:07,990 --> 00:08:08,650
Cha Dohyun?

100
00:08:08,780 --> 00:08:10,030
That tall and handsome guy?

101
00:08:10,030 --> 00:08:10,670
Give it back.

102
00:08:10,670 --> 00:08:12,040
Amazing! Are you close to him?

103
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:13,180
Give it back!

104
00:08:13,530 --> 00:08:14,800
Hello?

105
00:08:15,140 --> 00:08:15,990
Are you crazy?

106
00:08:16,150 --> 00:08:17,740
Damn, I almost got you.

107
00:08:18,090 --> 00:08:19,550
Does he have a girlfriend?

108
00:08:20,110 --> 00:08:21,050
No.

109
00:08:21,190 --> 00:08:23,000
Oh, my. Then introduce him to me.

110
00:08:23,940 --> 00:08:24,930
No.

111
00:08:24,940 --> 00:08:25,600
Why?

112
00:08:25,750 --> 00:08:27,810
He doesn't have a girlfriend, right?

113
00:08:29,110 --> 00:08:31,140
He has someone he likes.

114
00:08:35,169 --> 00:08:35,900
I'm leaving.

115
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:36,799
What's wrong?

116
00:08:37,470 --> 00:08:38,450
Where are you going so early?

117
00:08:38,450 --> 00:08:39,780
Then give me his number.

118
00:08:39,880 --> 00:08:40,549
I have to go.

119
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:42,549
Give me his number.

120
00:08:42,669 --> 00:08:43,830
Just his number.

121
00:08:54,030 --> 00:08:56,900
Oh, my. It's Cha Dohyun.

122
00:09:01,290 --> 00:09:04,820
Why did you make someone studying
run over here like a crazy dog?

123
00:09:05,070 --> 00:09:07,740
You really can make me
look like an idiot easily.

124
00:09:13,180 --> 00:09:14,400
Hey, you come out too.

125
00:09:14,990 --> 00:09:16,130
Quick!

126
00:09:27,070 --> 00:09:28,660
You're funny.

127
00:09:29,630 --> 00:09:31,300
Making me so annoyed.

128
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:43,420
Do you find it funny
hearing me say I like you.

129
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:49,280
Is this your answer?

130
00:09:55,630 --> 00:09:57,230
I got it, Yeo Eunho.

131
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:03,130
Cha Dohyun.

132
00:10:06,090 --> 00:10:08,530
Can you really not see me forever?

133
00:10:12,020 --> 00:10:13,080
Yes.

134
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:17,500
Do you think
I'll be scared by that threat?

135
00:11:18,070 --> 00:11:19,370
Ridiculous.

136
00:11:40,270 --> 00:11:42,080
Honey, wake up.

137
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:47,410
Yeo Eunho! Time for school!

138
00:11:51,150 --> 00:11:53,730
Gosh, you're ready already?

139
00:11:55,940 --> 00:11:57,470
I'm going to school.

140
00:11:57,690 --> 00:11:58,950
What about breakfast?

141
00:12:00,170 --> 00:12:01,430
I'm not hungry.

142
00:12:04,940 --> 00:12:06,300
You forgot your bag.

143
00:12:07,430 --> 00:12:10,750
Why are you playing with your phone
so early in the morning?

144
00:12:14,290 --> 00:12:15,810
I'm going to school.

145
00:12:17,770 --> 00:12:19,580
Hey, are you okay?

146
00:12:37,990 --> 00:12:40,870
[No new notifications]

147
00:12:56,190 --> 00:12:57,590
-Name tags.
-Yes.

148
00:12:57,710 --> 00:13:00,440
Remember to check
if they have their name tags on.

149
00:13:01,540 --> 00:13:04,660
Also, catch students
who aren't buttoned up.

150
00:13:04,760 --> 00:13:06,850
Check if their tie is on too.

151
00:13:06,860 --> 00:13:07,740
Okay.

152
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:16,970
[Yeo Eunho]

153
00:14:25,510 --> 00:14:27,730
Eunho, you're early.

154
00:14:29,270 --> 00:14:31,120
Hey, your slippers.

155
00:14:32,700 --> 00:14:34,780
I guess this is the trend these days.

156
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:37,400
Why didn't you tell me?

157
00:14:37,670 --> 00:14:39,270
I can't miss out on the trend.

158
00:14:39,310 --> 00:14:40,920
This is not bad.

159
00:15:14,320 --> 00:15:15,440
Hey, Eunho.

160
00:15:16,160 --> 00:15:17,080
Huh?

161
00:15:17,260 --> 00:15:20,650
What's up? You've been out of it.

162
00:16:04,140 --> 00:16:06,000
If it goes in, it means I like him.

163
00:16:07,610 --> 00:16:09,060
If it doesn't...

164
00:16:10,650 --> 00:16:11,910
then I don't.

165
00:16:23,270 --> 00:16:25,530
If it doesn't go in,
then I don't like him.

166
00:16:51,540 --> 00:16:53,130
Darn it.

167
00:16:56,310 --> 00:16:57,730
You jerk.

168
00:17:16,010 --> 00:17:17,670
You didn't bring an umbrella?

169
00:17:18,109 --> 00:17:19,190
Yeah.

170
00:17:19,390 --> 00:17:22,319
The weather forecast
didn't say it was going to rain.

171
00:17:22,790 --> 00:17:25,200
Thunder showers happen all of a sudden.

172
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:28,000
It's normal that it wasn't forecasted.

173
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:51,800
Do you want to share an umbrella?

174
00:17:55,290 --> 00:17:56,370
No.

175
00:17:57,390 --> 00:17:59,190
I'll leave after the rain stops.

176
00:18:01,550 --> 00:18:03,810
Okay, see you tomorrow.

177
00:19:02,410 --> 00:19:03,730
Cha Dohyun...

178
00:19:48,740 --> 00:19:51,320
Come out, Cha Dohyun.

179
00:19:53,600 --> 00:19:57,290
I'm cold, so come out immediately.

180
00:20:18,150 --> 00:20:19,200
Yeo Eunho.

181
00:20:22,530 --> 00:20:25,130
Can you really not see me forever?

182
00:20:48,860 --> 00:20:50,140
Cha Dohyun.

183
00:20:53,890 --> 00:20:55,550
I think I'm done for.

184
00:21:25,160 --> 00:21:31,840
[Summertime]

185
00:21:32,360 --> 00:21:33,630
I like you.

186
00:21:34,910 --> 00:21:37,370
I'm not going to be friends
with you anymore.

187
00:21:37,920 --> 00:21:39,520
I want to date you.

188
00:21:42,830 --> 00:21:43,780
Are you crazy?

189
00:21:44,610 --> 00:21:47,190
Are you crazy? We're in school.

190
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:51,240
Yeo Eunho.

191
00:21:51,730 --> 00:21:53,590
Do you want to come to my house now?

192
00:21:53,850 --> 00:21:55,880
You pervert. I'm hanging up.

193
00:21:57,510 --> 00:21:59,590
If you don't come, I'll go to you.

194
00:21:59,740 --> 00:22:01,430
Are you okay with anything?

195
00:22:01,780 --> 00:22:03,570
Is there nothing you want to do?

196
00:22:03,960 --> 00:22:06,330
You said you were childhood friends.

197
00:22:06,850 --> 00:22:09,370
How long do you think
this friendship will last?

198
00:22:09,370 --> 00:22:11,060
Going to different universities,

199
00:22:11,060 --> 00:22:13,630
doing different jobs—
you'll have to grow up one day.

200
00:22:13,630 --> 00:22:16,230
Friends or not,

201
00:22:16,380 --> 00:22:19,270
people will hang out with people
they're more alike with.

202
00:22:19,270 --> 00:22:20,310
Yes.

203
00:22:20,700 --> 00:22:22,200
Eunho, what's wrong?
